WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.350
Picture cloth being made by hand,
at home, one thread at a time.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.690
Now picture a huge
factory, full of machines,

3
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:12.090
driven by a steam engine
and fed with coal.

4
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.530
Britain was the first country in
the world to make this change.

5
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.450
Did it happen overnight,
like flicking a switch?

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.190
And what was life like for the
people who moved to the new

7
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.310
towns?

8
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.030
In this mission, you'll
meet the Enlightenment,

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.400
a new way of thinking.

10
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.550
You'll see factories,
steam and railways,

11
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.790
and life in crowded cities.

12
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.570
Your mission: find out how fast
Britain's Industrial Revolution

13
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:37.210
really happened.
